<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates falls to 1.98 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates falls to 1.98 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 1.98 percent on Tuesday from 2.11 percent on Monday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said four banks traded in 13 reported transactions worth 27.95 million dinars ($39.4 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
